Dear ALSA developer:

This is Sam Chu, the audio technical section manager of VIA Technologies,
Inc. We are very appreciation of your supporting 
on audio driver of VIA AC'97 controller and wish we can have more
cooperation in Linux audio driver development.
We know your team has supported VIA VT8233, but not for our VT8233A. So we
want to provide more information for you
to develop VIA audio driver. Data sheet, documentation,... anything you
want, you can tell us. We will do the best that we can do.

Thank you very much.

